header_text {
  translation {
    text: "A Line service change: beginning Sun Sep 27."
    language: "en"
  }
}
description_text {
  translation {
    text: "Change\r\nSchedule adjustments, modifying early morning and evening service frequencies as follows: 3 a.m. to 6 a.m.: 30-minute frequency 6:15 a.m. to 7:30 p.m.: 15-minute frequency 7:30 p.m. to end of service: 30-minute frequency (as compared to current schedule, which transitions to 30-minute frequency beginning with the 6:30 p.m. departure from Union Station and the 7:27 p.m. departure from Denver Airport). These changes to schedule timing will also result in the loss of (2) daily morning trips, the 5:45 a.m. eastbound and the 6:42 a.m. westbound.\r\n\nReason\r\nAdjusting the span of 15-minute service better aligns frequency with customer demand by providing more frequent service later into the evening. Schedule changes also create more consistent departure times during periods of 30-minute service, making the schedule easier to understand while improving operational efficiency and better aligning service with contractual requirements.\r\n\nSurvey Results\r\nOut of 152 respondents, 40% reported a positive impact from the change, 28% indicated it had no impact, and 32% perceived the change negatively."
    language: "en"
  }
}
severity_level: WARNING
